1
00:00:00,853 --> 00:00:02,923
"My name is Howard.
I can make your hair into diamonds.

2
00:00:03,088 --> 00:00:06,798
(Raj:)My mom is morbidly obese.
Everybody love me."

3
00:00:07,926 --> 00:00:09,596
(Howard:)Whoa, where is that coming from?

4
00:00:09,762 --> 00:00:11,762
(Raj:)I'll tell you where it's coming from.

5
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:13,640
(Raj:)All you do is make fun of me
for coming to girls' night,

6
00:00:13,799 --> 00:00:15,439
(Raj:)and now you're here ruining it
for everyone.

7
00:00:15,601 --> 00:00:19,281
(Penny:)Raj, cool it.
He's gonna make us hair diamonds.

8
00:00:20,205 --> 00:00:21,475
(Howard:)How am I ruining anything?

9
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,480
(Howard:)I'm just trying to help you
make better jewelry.

10
00:00:23,642 --> 00:00:25,422
But this isn't about the jewelry.

11
00:00:25,577 --> 00:00:29,047
(Raj:)This is about me having a place where
I can open up about my feelings.

12
00:00:29,648 --> 00:00:32,458
(Howard:)Since when can't you open up
with me?

13
00:00:32,618 --> 00:00:33,958
(Raj:)There are just some things

14
00:00:34,119 --> 00:00:35,789
(Raj:)that I feel more comfortable
sharing with the girls,

15
00:00:35,954 --> 00:00:37,664
(Raj:)because they won't make fun of me

16
00:00:37,823 --> 00:00:41,793
(Raj:)or and call me names, or ask me if my
"Koothrapanties are in a bunch."

17
00:00:45,497 --> 00:00:48,107
(Howard:)Buddy, I was just joking around.

18
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:49,977
(Raj:)Yeah, well,
sometimes your jokes hurt.

19
00:00:51,336 --> 00:00:52,476
(Howard:)You're right.

20
00:00:52,638 --> 00:00:55,348
(Howard:)I didn't realize
I was making you feel that way.

21
00:00:57,342 --> 00:00:59,582
(Howard:)It was very brave of you to tell me.

22
00:00:59,745 --> 00:01:01,025
(Raj:)Thank you.

